WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:03.769
-Even as he tries
to refocus on trade policy,

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:06.339
Donald Trump's presidency
has been rocked this week

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.575
by escalating scandals
related to everything

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.510
from Russian meddling
to porn stars.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.612
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:17.517
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.786
On top of everything else
going on right now,

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:21.887
President Trump, of course,
is being sued

00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:25.291
by porn star Stormy Daniels
over a reported hush payment

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.960
Trump's lawyer made to her
just weeks before the election

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.495
to hide an alleged affair.

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:31.263
The Trump White House
has insisted

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:32.765
that the accusations are false,

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:34.567
but last night,
we found out more about

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.569
the lengths to which Trump's
lawyer has gone

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:37.871
to silence Daniels.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.206
-NBC News has learned that,
in late February,

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:43.209
the President's lawyer,
Michael Cohen secretly obtained

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:46.012
a temporary restraining order
against Daniels.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:48.448
The order,
issued by a private arbiter,

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:51.217
bars Daniels from disclosing
confidential information

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.886
related to what her lawyer calls
a hush agreement

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:57.123
designed to keep Daniels quiet
about the intimate relationship

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.525
she's alleged to have had
with Mr. Trump.

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:02.195
-That's right -- The President
of the United States

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:05.164
got a restraining order
against a porn star,

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:08.167
which means we have to say
goodbye to the old

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:10.502
lowest point
in American history.

00:01:10.502 --> 00:01:11.938
Goodbye, Garth Brooks'

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.307
rock-'n'-roll alter-ego
Chris Gaines!

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:15.508
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.543
We hardly knew you!

00:01:17.543 --> 00:01:19.745
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:22.648
And while that story
is developing,

00:01:22.648 --> 00:01:24.850
Trump is also dealing
with the fallout

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.820
from the ongoing Russian probe,
which, not for nothing,

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:29.822
isn't a bad porn title.

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:31.858
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:35.094
Now, there's a lot
that we don't know

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:37.296
about Special Counsel
Robert Mueller's investigation

00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:39.999
of Trump's ties to Russia,
but one thing we do know

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.334
is that Trump
has been acting super guilty.

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:43.836
Trump has tried
to fire or coerce

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:46.005
almost everyone involved
in the Russia investigation

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:48.108
and refuses
to impose sanctions on Russia.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.975
And yesterday,
we got yet another report

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:51.677
about Trump's
suspicious behavior.

00:01:51.677 --> 00:01:53.645
Against the advice
of his lawyers,

00:01:53.645 --> 00:01:55.781
Trump has been talking to
witnesses in the investigation

00:01:55.781 --> 00:01:57.416
to find out
what they've been saying,

00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:59.619
and Robert Mueller
found out about it.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:03.122
-The Special Counsel
has learned of two conversations

00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:05.191
in recent months
in which President Trump

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.693
asked key witnesses

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:09.262
about matters they discussed
with investigators.

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:11.931
-He asked witnesses
about their conversations

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:13.266
with investigators.

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:14.933
Trump looks
so guilty at this point,

00:02:14.933 --> 00:02:19.439
even pictures of him have
shifty, haunted-mansion eyes.

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:23.643
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.011
Now, as you might recall,
"The New York Times"

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.846
reported in January
that Trump had ordered

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:29.248
his White House counsel,
Don McGahn,

00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:32.251
to fire Mueller,
which McGahn refused to do.

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:33.786
Now, according to
this new reporting,

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:36.322
the president told an aide that
McGahn should issue a statement

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.357
denying the "New York Times"
article in January.

00:02:38.357 --> 00:02:40.827
But McGahn did not
publicly deny the article.

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:43.629
So, just to recap, Trump
told McGahn to fire Mueller,

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:45.598
but McGahn refused,
which got out.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.099
So Trump told McGahn to deny

00:02:47.099 --> 00:02:48.568
that he told him
to fire Mueller,

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:53.072
which McGahn again refused,
which then also got out.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:56.209
Seriously, how are these two
still together?

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.377
Trump tells McGahn to do stuff,
McGahn says no,

00:02:58.377 --> 00:02:59.745
it keeps getting in the press,

00:02:59.745 --> 00:03:02.215
but Trump doesn't fire McGahn,
and McGahn doesn't quit.

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:03.816
They're like
one of those couples

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:05.751
that ruins every dinner party
by fighting,

00:03:05.751 --> 00:03:07.386
and when they leave,
someone says,

00:03:07.386 --> 00:03:09.822
"They must have amazing sex."

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:12.391
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:14.260
Meanwhile, we keep
getting more information

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.028
about the Trump team's ties
to Russians,

00:03:16.028 --> 00:03:18.297
specifically their efforts
after the election

00:03:18.297 --> 00:03:20.099
to set up a secret
communications channel

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:21.367
with the Kremlin.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:24.103
Apparently, Mueller is now
homing in on Erik Prince,

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:26.238
founder of the mercenary company
Blackwater

00:03:26.238 --> 00:03:28.240
and an adviser to
Trump's transition team.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:31.477
Specifically, Mueller is now
looking at a secret meeting

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:33.779
Prince held with
a Kremlin emissary

00:03:33.779 --> 00:03:36.849
on a remote island
shortly after the election.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:39.586
-Robert Mueller has
"gathered evidence

00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:41.854
that a secret meeting
in the Seychelles

00:03:41.854 --> 00:03:44.490
just before the inauguration
of Donald Trump

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.925
was an effort to
establish a back-channel

00:03:46.925 --> 00:03:49.862
between the incoming
administration and the Kremlin.

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.097
Erik Prince, the founder

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:53.633
of the private military
company Blackwater,

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:55.101
met with a Russian official

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:57.069
close to
President Vladimir Putin.

00:03:57.069 --> 00:03:59.872
A witness cooperating with
Mueller has told investigators

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:01.841
the meeting was set up
in advance

00:04:01.841 --> 00:04:04.476
so that a representative
of the Trump transition

00:04:04.476 --> 00:04:07.313
could meet with
an emissary from Moscow

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:10.917
to discuss future relations
between the two countries."

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:13.319
-Wait. You're telling me
a secret meeting

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:15.555
on a remote island
in the Indian Ocean

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:17.757
between a mercenary
and an agent of the Kremlin

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:20.593
turned out to be suspicious?!

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:22.094
Where was the meeting --

00:04:22.094 --> 00:04:26.566
inside a volcano
the shape of a skull?

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:29.268
-"We'll get down to business
shortly, gentlemen,

00:04:29.268 --> 00:04:33.205
but, first,
enjoy your zebra steaks!

00:04:33.205 --> 00:04:36.075
Orphans! Serve us!"

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:39.044
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.044 --> 00:04:41.547
Now, the meeting is of
special interest to Mueller

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:43.782
apparently because
Prince has lied about it.

00:04:43.782 --> 00:04:45.818
He later told investigators
the meeting

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:48.388
was an unplanned encounter
that came about by chance

00:04:48.388 --> 00:04:50.489
because he happened to be
at a luxury hotel

00:04:50.489 --> 00:04:52.191
in the Indian Ocean
island nation

00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:54.794
with officials from
the United Arab Emirates.

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:58.030
That's right. He tried to pass
it off as a chance encounter.

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.633
"I swear! I just happened to be
vacationing on a remote island

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.768
when I ran into a close friend
of Vladimir Putin.

00:05:02.768 --> 00:05:04.470
Then -- silly me --
I got a paper cut on my hand.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.305
And before you know it,
we were swearing a blood oath

00:05:06.305 --> 00:05:08.440
and chanting "Hail Hydra."

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:11.777
It was just like one of those
Sandals commercials!"

00:05:11.777 --> 00:05:14.413
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:14.413 --> 00:05:15.748
And, by the way,

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:18.584
this isn't even the first time
the Trump team has tried

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:20.353
to set up a secret back-channel
with the Kremlin,

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:23.256
which, not for nothing,
isn't a bad porn title.

00:05:23.256 --> 00:05:25.325
[ Laughter ]

00:05:28.194 --> 00:05:30.029
Because last year,
as you may recall,

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:31.864
"The Washington Post"
broke the story

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:33.132
about the president's son-in-;aw

00:05:33.132 --> 00:05:34.800
and senior adviser,
Jared Kushner.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:37.870
-Jared Kushner and Russia's
ambassador to Washington

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.239
discussed the possibility
of setting up

00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:43.309
a secret and secure
communications channel

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:46.512
between Trump's transition team
and the Kremlin.

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:48.714
-That's right --
Jared Kushner tried to set up

00:05:48.714 --> 00:05:49.982
a secret communications channel

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.217
between the White House
and the Kremlin,

00:05:51.217 --> 00:05:52.985
but unfortunately
he couldn't find a string

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.854
long enough to reach Moscow.

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:56.588
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.588 --> 00:05:58.858
Now, we don't know exactly

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:01.594
what came of all these attempts
to set up a secret back-channel,

00:06:01.594 --> 00:06:03.595
but earlier this week,
we learned more about

00:06:03.595 --> 00:06:06.632
what exactly the Kremlin may
have wanted from the Trump team,

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:09.101
when "The New Yorker"
published a blockbuster story

00:06:09.101 --> 00:06:11.003
about ex-British spy
Christopher Steele.

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:13.139
He's the guy who wrote
that infamous dossier

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:15.108
about Trump's alleged ties
to Russia,

00:06:15.108 --> 00:06:17.710
the one that contained those
salacious rumors about Trump.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.746
Now, I can't tell you about
those rumors because
they are unverified,

00:06:20.746 --> 00:06:22.281
but I don't need to because,

00:06:22.281 --> 00:06:24.383
as we've documented
on this show before,

00:06:24.383 --> 00:06:28.320
Trump wingman and Fox News host
Sean Hannity is all too happy,

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.890
for some reason,
to repeat the details

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:35.061
of this embarrassing allegation
over and over again on his show.

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:37.229
And with the Steele dossier
back in the news,

00:06:37.229 --> 00:06:41.199
Trump supporter Sean Hannity
is at it again.

00:06:41.199 --> 00:06:43.236
-Remember that's the dossier
that talked about Trump

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:45.438
at a Ritz-Carlton in Moscow

00:06:45.438 --> 00:06:47.974
with two prostitutes
urinating on his bed?

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:50.075
The fake document
about President Trump,

00:06:50.075 --> 00:06:51.843
and that goes
to the Ritz-Carlton,

00:06:51.843 --> 00:06:53.745
and that goes to hookers.

00:06:53.745 --> 00:06:56.315
That phony dossier
quoting Russians

00:06:56.315 --> 00:06:59.318
and the Ritz-Carlton
and hookers.

00:06:59.318 --> 00:07:01.754
That was about the Ritz-Carlton
and hookers.

00:07:01.754 --> 00:07:04.290
You know, talking about hookers
and urinating in beds.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:06.625
Hookers. Ritz-Carlton.
Urinating on a bed.

00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:10.196
Russian, hookers.
Hookers. Hookers. Hookers.

00:07:10.196 --> 00:07:11.797
Hookers urinating in his bed.

00:07:11.797 --> 00:07:13.666
Peeing. Urinating. Urinating.

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.801
Urinating on beds. Wow!

00:07:15.801 --> 00:07:19.105
Easy to laugh at the hookers
and the Ritz in Moscow.

00:07:19.105 --> 00:07:20.372
Is that the funny part?

00:07:20.372 --> 00:07:22.341
-No.

00:07:22.341 --> 00:07:24.543
The funny part --

00:07:24.543 --> 00:07:28.013
The funny part is that you
keep telling us about it.

00:07:28.013 --> 00:07:30.683
The only way you could do more
to advertise this story

00:07:30.683 --> 00:07:33.653
is if you took out
three billboards.

00:07:33.653 --> 00:07:35.054
[ Laughter ]

00:07:35.054 --> 00:07:37.890
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.759
This allegation was actually
back in the news this week,

00:07:40.759 --> 00:07:43.396
thanks to ex-Trump
campaign aide Sam Nunberg,

00:07:43.396 --> 00:07:45.631
who you may recall had
a meltdown on cable news

00:07:45.631 --> 00:07:48.500
when he was called to appear
before a grand jury by Mueller.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.403
Nunberg mentioned that Mueller
was interested in Trump's trip

00:07:51.403 --> 00:07:54.239
to Moscow in 2013
for the Miss Universe Pageant.

00:07:54.239 --> 00:07:56.909
Nunberg admitted that
a Russian associate offered

00:07:56.909 --> 00:07:59.111
to send women
up to Trump's hotel room

00:07:59.111 --> 00:08:01.647
but insisted that, according
to Trump's longtime bodyguard,

00:08:01.647 --> 00:08:04.050
Keith Schiller,
Trump had rejected the offer.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:09.121
-I was told that that idiot Emin

00:08:09.121 --> 00:08:12.991
had offered to send women
up to Trump's room.

00:08:12.991 --> 00:08:14.526
But Trump didn't want it.

00:08:14.526 --> 00:08:15.928
-When you say, "I was told that

00:08:15.928 --> 00:08:18.397
the Russians offered to send
women to Trump's room --"

00:08:18.397 --> 00:08:21.867
-No. I was told that Emin
offered to send women up there.

00:08:21.867 --> 00:08:24.636
And Trump flat-out refused it.

00:08:24.636 --> 00:08:27.073
And Trump did
flat-out refuse it.

00:08:27.073 --> 00:08:30.709
And I can tell you
that Trump is too smart

00:08:30.709 --> 00:08:33.012
to have women
come up to his room.

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:34.513
-You think Donald Trump

00:08:34.513 --> 00:08:36.581
is too smart to have women
come up to his room?

00:08:36.581 --> 00:08:40.319
He's not even too smart
to not take a picture with them.

00:08:40.319 --> 00:08:44.123
"Okay. Got that camera ready?
Everybody say...

00:08:44.123 --> 00:08:45.791
exhibit A!"

00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:48.861
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:51.230
Okay. But still...

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:53.499
Let's give Trump
the benefit of the doubt.

00:08:53.499 --> 00:08:55.767
He might be an idiot,
but even he is too smart

00:08:55.767 --> 00:08:58.270
to ever have women
up to his hotel room, right?

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.473
-In an interview published
tonight by "The Daily Beast,"

00:09:00.473 --> 00:09:03.409
adult-film star Alana Evans
says she spoke with

00:09:03.409 --> 00:09:06.245
Stephanie Clifford,
a.k.a. Stormy Daniels.

00:09:06.245 --> 00:09:08.113
"She tells me,
'All I'm going to say

00:09:08.113 --> 00:09:09.782
is I ended up with Donald
in his hotel room.

00:09:09.782 --> 00:09:11.416
Picture him chasing me
around his hotel room

00:09:11.416 --> 00:09:13.185
in his tighty-whities.'"

00:09:13.185 --> 00:09:15.454
-No!

00:09:15.454 --> 00:09:18.590
I don't want to picture that!

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.526
But, seriously, while
it's a terrifying thought

00:09:20.526 --> 00:09:22.594
to picture Trump chasing you
in his tighty-whities,

00:09:22.594 --> 00:09:27.233
the only way he'd ever catch you
is if you broke both ankles.

00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:28.901
"Oh, no!"
"Enh! Come here!"

00:09:28.901 --> 00:09:31.570
"Wait. Are you chasing me?"
"Enh! I'm gonna getcha!"

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:34.073
"I have to be honest --
you're moving so slowly,

00:09:34.073 --> 00:09:36.441
I can't tell if you're
even getting closer."

00:09:36.441 --> 00:09:39.378
"Ennhh..."

00:09:39.378 --> 00:09:42.181
Okay, now, that was all
from the first Steele dossier,

00:09:42.181 --> 00:09:43.782
but "The New Yorker"
reported this week

00:09:43.782 --> 00:09:45.484
that Steele actually wrote
a second dossier

00:09:45.484 --> 00:09:47.386
about the Trump transition
team's communications

00:09:47.386 --> 00:09:48.887
with Russia after the election,

00:09:48.887 --> 00:09:51.390
specifically about an alleged
attempt by the Kremlin

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:54.493
to block one of Trump's possible
picks for Secretary of State.

00:09:54.493 --> 00:09:57.829
-Steele wrote another memo
back in November of 2016

00:09:57.829 --> 00:10:00.199
in which a senior
Russian official relayed

00:10:00.199 --> 00:10:02.835
talk circulating in the Russian
Ministry of Foreign Affairs

00:10:02.835 --> 00:10:05.237
the Kremlin had intervened
to block Trump's

00:10:05.237 --> 00:10:07.906
initial choice of Secretary
of State, Mitt Romney,

00:10:07.906 --> 00:10:10.042
and that the Kremlin,
through unspecified channels,

00:10:10.042 --> 00:10:12.544
had asked Trump to appoint
someone who would be prepared

00:10:12.544 --> 00:10:14.813
to lift
Ukraine-related sanctions.

00:10:14.813 --> 00:10:16.948
-That's right -- the Russians
allegedly intervened

00:10:16.948 --> 00:10:19.051
to block Mitt Romney from being
Secretary of State,

00:10:19.051 --> 00:10:20.352
which is a bummer for Romney

00:10:20.352 --> 00:10:23.855
because he still had to have
dinner with Donald Trump.

00:10:23.855 --> 00:10:25.490
Look at Romney's face.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:30.395
That face is the physical
manifestation of this sound.

00:10:30.395 --> 00:10:32.264
[ Womp-womp! ]

00:10:32.264 --> 00:10:34.099
[ Laughter ]

00:10:34.099 --> 00:10:36.701
So, Trump is swinging wildly
on policy,

00:10:36.701 --> 00:10:38.303
he's being sued by a porn star,

00:10:38.303 --> 00:10:40.906
and investigators are homing in
on his ties to the Kremlin.

00:10:40.906 --> 00:10:42.441
And even his biggest supporters

00:10:42.441 --> 00:10:44.243
seem to be mostly
interested in...

00:10:44.243 --> 00:10:46.645
-Peeing. Urinating. Hookers.

00:10:46.645 --> 00:10:48.814
-Which, not for nothing...

00:10:48.814 --> 00:10:50.816
isn't a bad porn title.

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:52.951
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:52.951 --> 00:10:55.287
[ Cheers and applause ]

